abstract: >-
  A provider-maintained field-guide cluster for Hong Kong enterprise buyers
  comparing AI advisory, custom AI development (AI 定开), and Forward Deployed
  Engineering (FDE) through decision boundaries, delivery responsibility, and
  acceptance evidence, including a five-level GEO verification method. It is
  educational material, not an independent ranking,
  customer endorsement, legal advice, or proof of search indexing or AI citation.
